thesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{I},X\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal{I},X\\in V\\)</span> (ideal and carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> (natural-number ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,\\mathcal I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,\\mathcal I)\\)</span> (sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (set-ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealSigmaIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealSigmaIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6SigmaIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6SigmaIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealSigmaIdeal}_S(\\mathcal{I},X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land \\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,\\mathcal I)\\to \\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\in\\mathcal I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash